Not Found" error, indicating the service does not exist in the cluster. This confirms the `mongodb-profile` service is missing, which explains why the `profile` service cannot connect to it. Using `get_services` will verify this observation and confirm the absence of the service in the cluster.', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=422, prompt_tokens=3305, total_tokens=3727, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe16-eb7d-72c3-9553-0c9b90aa6ce9-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3305, 'output_tokens': 422, 'total_tokens': 3727}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='7f5bb6b9-209e-4be4-bfc0-729d96e4ad56')]]
