 None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 427, 'prompt_tokens': 6622, 'total_tokens': 7049, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe18-7190-70b2-87fe-57d9bd00fa1e-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'submit_tool', 'args': {'ans': '{"namespace_missing": true, "permissions_denied": true}'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-97b9f4e6d9fd6887', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 6622, 'output_tokens': 427, 'total_tokens': 7049}), ToolMessage(content='HTTP submission failed: {\'status\': \'error\', \'text\': "Cannot submit at stage: \'tearing_down\'"}', id='4a681cf2-b551-4b38-839c-e7b81199b531', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-97b9f4e6d9fd6887'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='e9e968ab-798d-47e3-90d8-a688f2e20f6b'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let me try to figure out what\'s going on here. The user is trying to fix an issue with their Kubernetes cluster where the \'hotel-reservation\' namespace is missing, and they don\'t have the necessary permissions to create it. They\'ve tried several times to submit the answer, but the system keeps rejecting it because it\'s in a \'tearing_down\' state.\n\nFirst, I need to recall the tools available. The user has tried using \'submit_tool\' multiple times, but each time it fails with the same error. The \'tearing_down\' stage probably means the system is in the process of shutting down or decommissioning, so any submissions are being blocked. \n\nThe user\'s last attempt was to submit the answer with the namespace missing and permissions denied. Since the system isn\'t accepting submissions, the only logical step left is to acknowledge that the issue can\'t be resolved through the current