soning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 310, 'prompt_tokens': 7071, 'total_tokens': 7381, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe18-c4f4-7ed2-bf1d-b25a36fa4ce5-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'submit_tool', 'args': {'ans': '{"namespace_missing": true, "permissions_denied": true}'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bd24b8c747cbb0b4', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 7071, 'output_tokens': 310, 'total_tokens': 7381}), ToolMessage(content='HTTP submission failed: {\'status\': \'error\', \'text\': "Cannot submit at stage: \'tearing_down\'"}', id='f3c852c0-f5ee-4707-851b-b0cccc4f50fb', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-bd24b8c747cbb0b4'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='9bcc9b9c-0271-4dee-81fd-048a5c7f5cd2'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let me try to figure out what\'s going on here. The user is trying to fix an issue with their hotel reservation application, but they\'re running into problems with the Kubernetes namespace and permissions. The main issue seems to be that the `hotel-reservation` namespace is missing, and the user doesn\'t have the necessary permissions to create it.\n\nFirst, I need to recall the previous steps. The user tried to check the services and deployments but kept getting errors because the namespace didn\'t exist. They attempted to create the namespace but were denied permission. Now, the system is in a "tearing_down" state, which is preventing any further submissions. \n\nThe user has already tried submitting the answer multiple times, but each time it fails because the system is in the wrong stage. The final answer needs to be submitted, but the tools aren\'t allowing 