e remains the missing `hotel-reservation` namespace and lack of cluster permissions. No further tool calls can resolve this without administrative access. \n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe `hotel-reservation` namespace is missing, and the user lacks cluster-level permissions to create it. Contact the cluster administrator to create the namespace and reattempt the deployment.  \n```python\nsubmit_tool(ans={"namespace_missing": True, "permissions_denied": True})\n```', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=427, prompt_tokens=6871, total_tokens=7298, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe19-435c-7341-bcf2-f4dcb465891e-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 6871, 'output_tokens': 427, 'total_tokens': 7298}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='1ecaea07-ae12-443b-ac0e-8fb5f83ebbbf')]]
