es the pod's labels and that the pod is properly exposed.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"ans": "{\\"namespace_missing\\": true, \\"permissions_denied\\": true}"}', 'name': 'submit_tool'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-99c9a29c344f5787', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 528, 'prompt_tokens': 8757, 'total_tokens': 9285, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe19-e13f-7aa3-a898-048f8f86e850-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'submit_tool', 'args': {'ans': '{"namespace_missing": true, "permissions_denied": true}'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-99c9a29c344f5787', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 8757, 'output_tokens': 528, 'total_tokens': 9285}), ToolMessage(content='HTTP submission failed: {\'status\': \'error\', \'text\': "Cannot submit at stage: \'tearing_down\'"}', id='6cbb532e-85e5-4adc-91a7-15a026f27481', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-99c9a29c344f5787'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='a04e8547-3ef0-4dfc-b1d1-d8e081e122ce'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let me try to figure out what\'s going on here. The user is trying to resolve an issue with their hotel reservation application, but they\'re stuck because the system is in a "tearing_down" state. They\'ve tried multiple times to submit the answer, but each time it fails with the same error. \n\nFirst, I need to understand why the system is in "tearing_down" mode. This usually means that the cluster is being decommissioned or there\'s a process that\'s actively removing resources. Since the user can\'t submit answers anymore, they need to